AI-Enabled Risk Stratification tools that personalize examination frequency and scope
Cross-Sector Partnerships with fitness trackers, nutrition apps, and wellness platforms

Asia-Pacific represents the most dynamic growth market, with countries like China and India implementing national preventive health strategies that include subsidized screening programs for major diseases.

